Based on the archival scan of **Page 23** of the *North Kent Leader* from January 12, 1977, I have deconstructed the content into a first-person social media feed. 

The editorial regarding the timber shortage has been split into five distinct perspectives from the community, and the advertisements for the Morley Antique Auction and Jordan West registration have been formatted as immersive updates and ads.

